# MC-X-F1 (the cause, found in the judge's household: ENGINE-INVARIANT, E §9 invariant 5, on a ledger replay when
# another ask ran first). L §5.19: a link is judged "by existence, at the ask's cut ... by its keys, where and when";
# an instance fulfilled at that cut is counted by its observations. To judge r1's link, probe[2026-03]'s when reads
# flows(adv_pay[2026-03], 2026-03), whose instance r2 fulfils: refcore judged every link in one pass and handed the
# half-built table to that read, so adv_pay[2026-03] counted no observation (open, 0.00), probe[2026-03] didn't exist
# and r1 was refused RUN-RECORD; in the household the same stale count changed pit28_pay's amount with the order of
# the asks. Each target's links are now judged on their own. Hand-checked: f is r2's 150.00 PLN (150 > adv = 100, so
# probe[2026-03] exists); konto on 2026-03-31 = 1 000 - 100 (Jan) - 100 (Feb) - 10 (r1) - 150 (r2) = 640.00 PLN
# (probe[2026-01] and [2026-02] have false whens: 100 is not > 100).
=== m.tally
model m
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-19
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source plan "plan"
source bank "bank"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
input bank_rows: observed
input adv: money PLN
input fee: money PLN
input adv_dom: int
input probe_dom: int
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place us: outside lives 1900-01-01..
place unexplained: outside lives 1900-01-01..

move adv_pay[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, adv_dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from konto to us amount adv

move probe[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, probe_dom)
  at start_of(m)
  when flows(adv_pay[m], m) > adv
  leg cash from konto to us amount fee

ask q: bal(konto, 2026-03-31)
ask f: flows(adv_pay[2026-03], 2026-03)

version plan_2026
  cite plan
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  adv = 100.00 PLN "own"
  fee = 10.00 PLN "own"
  adv_dom = 20 "own"
  probe_dom = 5 "own"
  opening[konto] = 1 000.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"

version stmt
  cite bank
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-02
  covers konto
  pad konto from unexplained
  bank_rows[r1] = (on: 2026-03-05, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to us amount 10.00 PLN, fulfils: probe[2026-03]) "line 1"
  bank_rows[r2] = (on: 2026-03-20, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to us amount 150.00 PLN, fulfils: adv_pay[2026-03]) "line 2"
=== expect f q
f: 150.00 PLN
  cut 2026-10-19
q: 640.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: adv_pay[2026-01]
  unfulfilled: adv_pay[2026-02]
  cut 2026-10-19
